  "title": "Chef John&#39;s French Omelette",
  "description": "A true French omelette is just eggs and butter, no filling. The egg is cooked in a nonstick pan and folded for a soft, tender texture that you&#39;ll love!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
